{
  "note": "Schema-level fixtures for the promoted representation contract (0.4.1-draft). Every valid fixture must pass with format assertion on; every invalid fixture must fail AT ITS INTENDED GATE, which is what expected_schema_path_contains asserts. A fixture that merely fails is not evidence the gate works.",
  "fixtures": [
    {
